- `bitcoin_cryptocurrency_coin_redraw.py`
- `bitcoin-cryptocurrency-coin_redraw.svg`
- `bitcoin-cryptocurrency-coin_redraw.png`
- `bitcoin-cryptocurrency-coin_redraw-48.png`

